    LLM: "Priority #1 is capturing Aces and 10s. Since you must overplay, high cards are very powerful for clearing out opponent's trumps early.\n\nThe Lead: Winning the contract is crucial because it allows you to lead and declare your strongest marriage as trump immediately.\n\nCard Exchange: When exchanging cards with your partner, pass cards that help them complete a marriage or cards that 'void' a suit in your hand so you can use trumps.",
